From: Project Luma
Subject: [PATCH] luma: shelf parity with the spec screens

Spanning shelves keep 14 at both ends and their island shadows. Extension
indicators join the Well as 28px items instead of a second island after the
clock. Status dividers are 1x24 in the line colour, the Well is 36 high with
its dot in the item's corner, and the quick-settings glyphs are outlined
Lucide icons. The clock centres time over date at 13/16 and 11/14, hover
fills only the grid or the clock, shelf text is Figtree, the running dot is
ink, pinned and running-only apps are divided, and media controls use Lucide
glyphs at 16 with an "Artist · Source" subtitle.
---
